    light x=-14.8 y=3 z=23.6 radius=9.5 brightness=1.0
    light x=-7.2 y=-3.25 z=22.4 radius=14 brightness=0.44
    light x=-39 y=11.5 z=29.6 radius=17.5 brightness=0.20

    portal to=vault x0=-14.4 y0=0 z0=27.2 x1=-14.4 y1=5.6 z1=32 dir=px
